# ── ro_b.zx — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands
config/whatsapp_web/
# somebody your WhatsApp account, not just a key
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
# phone apps paired for Remote Control
config/paired_devices.json

# ── Habibi: private files that must never be uploaded ─────────────────────────
# encryption key for your stored data
config/secret.key
config/chat_history.json
config/hey_habibi.onnx
# old copies — includes a copy of api_keys.json
_backup_before_habibi/
phone_app/.gradle/
phone_app/build/
phone_app/app/build/
phone_app/local.properties

# Habibi personality and mood (personal)
config/persona.json
config/mood.json

# Android signing key - NEVER upload
signing/
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.b64
